button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">March\u00e9s publics<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9460b5 elementor-mobile-align-right elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"f9460b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/je-suis\/je-suis-une-administration-publique\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">En savoir plus<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c959fc6 e-con-full elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c959fc6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"entreprise\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db3845d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"db3845d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80e782d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"80e782d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcf6879 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dcf6879\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Entreprise \u2014 Sous-traitance sociale en Wallonie<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1efb6f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b1efb6f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Un partenaire professionnel et flexible<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c0ad82c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c0ad82c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section-header\"><p>Les\u00a0<b>entreprises de travail adapt\u00e9 (ETA)<\/b>\u00a0sont des acteurs \u00e9conomiques \u00e0 part enti\u00e8re, sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s dans la\u00a0<b>sous-traitance pour les entreprises<\/b>.<\/p><p>Elles interviennent dans de nombreux secteurs : logistique, conditionnement, assemblage, nettoyage industriel, espaces verts, maintenance, imprimerie, etc.<\/p><p>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des \u00e9quipes form\u00e9es et des infrastructures adapt\u00e9es, les ETA garantissent des prestations fiables, structur\u00e9es et comp\u00e9titives.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c5542ef e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c5542ef\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c519fe elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"0c519fe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/annuaire-eta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Annuaire des ETA<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5518ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"d5518ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/secteur\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Secteurs<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f11607e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f11607e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-171d89d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"171d89d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAQ sp\u00e9cifique<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bab8272 elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion\" data-id=\"bab8272\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;all_collapsed&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"nested-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-n-accordion\" aria-label=\"Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1950\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1950\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Quels types de services peut-on confier \u00e0 une ETA ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1950\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2c411a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a2c411a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b712a96 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b712a96\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Les ETA couvrent une <strong>large palette de secteurs<\/strong> : espaces verts, nettoyage et blanchisserie, conditionnement et logistique, menuiserie, construction, imprimerie, alimentation et restauration, montage technique, soutien administratif, textile, travail du m\u00e9tal\u2026<\/p><p>Certaines interviennent dans des <strong>domaines \u00e0 hauts standards<\/strong> comme l&rsquo;industrie pharmaceutique ou l&rsquo;a\u00e9ronautique.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70dba46 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"70dba46\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/secteur\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir tous les secteurs d'activit\u00e9<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1951\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1951\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> En tant qu'entreprise, comment collaborer avec une ETA ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1951\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d300c5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7d300c5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55aeb76 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"55aeb76\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Deux formes principales :<\/p><ul><li>la <strong>sous-traitance classique<\/strong> : missions ponctuelles ou partenariats de long terme.<\/li><li>le <strong>contrat d&rsquo;entreprises<\/strong> (ou insourcing) : une \u00e9quipe ETA d\u00e9di\u00e9e intervient directement sur votre site, encadr\u00e9e par l&rsquo;ETA, pour prendre en charge certaines activit\u00e9s de fa\u00e7on flexible et s\u00e9curis\u00e9e.<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Les ETA s&rsquo;adaptent \u00e0 des volumes variables, des d\u00e9lais serr\u00e9s et des cahiers des charges pr\u00e9cis.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa7f0c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"fa7f0c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/?page_id=5258526\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Pourquoi collaborer avec une ETA<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1952\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1952\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Les ETA sont-elles pr\u00e9sentes dans toute la Wallonie ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1952\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fbb7f7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3fbb7f7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11deb9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"11deb9b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Oui.<\/strong> Les ETA sont r\u00e9parties sur l&rsquo;ensemble de la <strong>R\u00e9gion wallonne<\/strong> et de la <strong>Communaut\u00e9 germanophone<\/strong>. Leurs services sont non-d\u00e9localisables, ancr\u00e9s dans leur territoire, avec une r\u00e9activit\u00e9 et une proximit\u00e9 que les prestataires ext\u00e9rieurs ne peuvent pas offrir.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0f1564 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"f0f1564\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/annuaire-eta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Consulter l'annuaire des ETA<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1953\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1953\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Qu'est-ce qu'EWETA ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1953\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0d3c376 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0d3c376\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d76ed25 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d76ed25\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>EWETA est la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonne des Entreprises de Travail Adapt\u00e9.<\/strong> Elle repr\u00e9sente et soutient les ETA de Wallonie et de la Communaut\u00e9 germanophone, d\u00e9fend leurs int\u00e9r\u00eats aupr\u00e8s des pouvoirs publics, et g\u00e8re ce site web, qui est le point d&rsquo;entr\u00e9e centralis\u00e9 pour <a href=\"\/annuaire-eta\">trouver une ETA<\/a>, <a href=\"\/secteur\">d\u00e9couvrir les secteurs d&rsquo;activit\u00e9<\/a> et <a href=\"\/pouvoirs-publics\">comprendre le cadre l\u00e9gal du secteur<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application\/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Quels types de services peut-on confier \\u00e0 une ETA ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Les ETA couvrent une large palette de secteurs : espaces verts, nettoyage et blanchisserie, conditionnement et logistique, menuiserie, construction, imprimerie, alimentation et restauration, montage technique, soutien administratif, textile, travail du m\\u00e9tal\\u2026Certaines interviennent dans des domaines \\u00e0 hauts standards comme l&rsquo;industrie pharmaceutique ou l&rsquo;a\\u00e9ronautique.\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tD\\u00e9couvrir tous les secteurs d'activit\\u00e9\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"En tant qu'entreprise, comment collaborer avec une ETA ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Deux formes principales :la sous-traitance classique : missions ponctuelles ou partenariats de long terme.le contrat d&rsquo;entreprises (ou insourcing) : une \\u00e9quipe ETA d\\u00e9di\\u00e9e intervient directement sur votre site, encadr\\u00e9e par l&rsquo;ETA, pour prendre en charge certaines activit\\u00e9s de fa\\u00e7on flexible et s\\u00e9curis\\u00e9e.\\u00a0Les ETA s&rsquo;adaptent \\u00e0 des volumes variables, des d\\u00e9lais serr\\u00e9s et des cahiers des charges pr\\u00e9cis.\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPourquoi collaborer avec une ETA\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Les ETA sont-elles pr\\u00e9sentes dans toute la Wallonie ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Oui. Les ETA sont r\\u00e9parties sur l&rsquo;ensemble de la R\\u00e9gion wallonne et de la Communaut\\u00e9 germanophone. Leurs services sont non-d\\u00e9localisables, ancr\\u00e9s dans leur territoire, avec une r\\u00e9activit\\u00e9 et une proximit\\u00e9 que les prestataires ext\\u00e9rieurs ne peuvent pas offrir.\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tConsulter l'annuaire des ETA\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Qu'est-ce qu'EWETA ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"EWETA est la F\\u00e9d\\u00e9ration Wallonne des Entreprises de Travail Adapt\\u00e9. Elle repr\\u00e9sente et soutient les ETA de Wallonie et de la Communaut\\u00e9 germanophone, d\\u00e9fend leurs int\\u00e9r\\u00eats aupr\\u00e8s des pouvoirs publics, et g\\u00e8re ce site web, qui est le point d&rsquo;entr\\u00e9e centralis\\u00e9 pour trouver une ETA, d\\u00e9couvrir les secteurs d&rsquo;activit\\u00e9 et comprendre le cadre l\\u00e9gal du secteur.\"}}]}<\/script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d01ec3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3d01ec3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1626df8 elementor-arrows-position-outside elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-carousel\" data-id=\"1626df8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;slides_to_show&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;navigation&quot;:&quot;arrows&quot;,&quot;image_spacing_custom&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_hover&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_interaction&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;autoplay_speed&quot;:5000,&quot;infinite&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:500,&quot;image_spacing_custom_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;image_spacing_custom_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"image-carousel.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-carousel-wrapper swiper\" role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" aria-label=\"Carroussel Entreprise\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-carousel swiper-wrapper\" aria-live=\"off\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"1 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Village-N-1-Entreprises-Nettoyage-industriel-2-rkx92lixxyaomtwgeyqsen21tau4hahbjmzvsva4rk.png\" alt=\"Nettoyage industriel - Village N 1 Entreprises\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Village N 1 Entreprises<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"2 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/ENtra-Call-center-1-rkeef0p7dlb2q64roa41dv40cqz6sat36jw5u085gg.png\" alt=\"Call center - Entra\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Entra<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"3 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Atelier-St-Vincent-Uniformes-de-travail-1-rkeclbr9qfdnb9jz9vup4fw9rarotu0fheiidtmobk.jpg\" alt=\"Entretien et r\u00e9paration d&#039;uniformes - Atelier St Vincent\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Atelier St Vincent <\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"4 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Metalgroup-impression-4-rke8s49e41jukeuvh2q7nkd03h1u8eayya9xgr2ilc.jpg\" alt=\"Impression - Metalgroup\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Impression - Metalgroup<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"5 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Les-Gaillettes-Emballage-8-rke5dpq04pzmognm85z6ygc394d3vcdbgfxnnkk4v4.jpg\" alt=\"Emballage - Les Gaillettes\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Les Gaillettes<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"6 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Village-N-1-Entreprises-Emballage-7-rke5r3x7iqbq4f770geszknjzscek2jmaqlquip674.png\" alt=\"Emballage - Village N 1 Entreprises\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Village N 1 Entreprises<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"7 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Le-Saupont-Salles-blanches-2-rke3xr76cev0wg4nmpfm4kct4cgodo3gz9pemxlktc.jpg\" alt=\"Salles blanches - Le Saupont\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Le Saupont<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"8 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/La-Thierache-Traiteur-2-rke3cj0e03swpgyol13xbf726339jqtp27bngz2nc0.png\" alt=\"Traiteur - La Thie\u0301rache\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">La Thie\u0301rache<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"9 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Trait-d_Union-Serigraphie-2-rkefpu1trje6z04pb0m42jthgm8b5lnta9lrb4t9k0.jpg\" alt=\"Personnalisation textile - s\u00e9rigraphie - Trait d&#039;Union\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Trait d'Union<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"10 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/HD_Realisations-METALGROUP-10-rkea051a6ptaaywwf3r7fgg5n42oq32f066kl9sr6o.jpg\" alt=\"Re\u0301alisations PVC - Metalgroup\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Metalgroup<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"11 sur 11\"><figure class=\"swiper-slide-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"swiper-slide-image\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Trait-d_Union-lettrage-branding-rke8vo3fxieufdp6qlzh2o3ovvjrb8egruzyqdsz34.png\" alt=\"Lettrage branding - Trait d&#039;Union\" \/><figcaption class=\"elementor-image-carousel-caption\">Trait d'Union<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-swiper-button elementor-swiper-button-prev\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-eicon-chevron-left\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-swiper-button elementor-swiper-button-next\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-eicon-chevron-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8d0bbe1 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8d0bbe1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a13f3e1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a13f3e1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e2c3c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6e2c3c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Performance, qualit\u00e9 et certifications\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce977a7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ce977a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Les ETA r\u00e9pondent aux exigences du march\u00e9 en mati\u00e8re de qualit\u00e9 et de productivit\u00e9.<br \/>Beaucoup disposent de certifications (ISO, qualit\u00e9, s\u00e9curit\u00e9) et appliquent des proc\u00e9dures rigoureuses.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b900483 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b900483\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-395f855 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"395f855\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Elles offrent :<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0421712 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0421712\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>une qualit\u00e9 constante<\/li><li>le respect des d\u00e9lais<\/li><li>une capacit\u00e9 d\u2019adaptation \u00e0 vos processus industriels<\/li><li>un encadrement professionnel<\/li><\/ul><p>De nombreuses entreprises font d\u00e9j\u00e0 confiance aux ETA pour externaliser certaines activit\u00e9s, <strong>pourquoi pas vous ?<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88ad470 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"88ad470\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3156dc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3156dc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Un levier pour accompagner votre croissance<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95d51a4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"95d51a4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Les ETA constituent un v\u00e9ritable atout pour :<\/p><ul><li aria-level=\"1\">absorber des pics de production<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\">externaliser certaines t\u00e2ches<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\">accompagner une strat\u00e9gie de\u00a0<b>scaling up<\/b><\/li><li aria-level=\"1\">gagner en flexibilit\u00e9 op\u00e9rationnelle<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Elles s\u2019int\u00e8grent facilement dans vos cha\u00eenes de valeur et s\u2019adaptent \u00e0 vos contraintes techniques et organisationnelles.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd492f7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fd492f7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ebbaa19 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ebbaa19\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Une collaboration responsable (sans compromis sur la performance)<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e7ec955 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e7ec955\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>En travaillant avec une ETA, vous renforcez \u00e9galement votre d\u00e9marche RSE, en soutenant l\u2019emploi de\u00a0<b>personnes en situation de handicap<\/b>.<\/p><p>Cette dimension sociale s\u2019ajoute \u00e0 la performance \u00e9conomique, sans jamais la remplacer.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e1aa54a e-con-full elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e1aa54a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"particulier\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2fda1ca e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2fda1ca\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-061c894 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"061c894\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c42389 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8c42389\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Particulier \u2014 trouver un service ETA pr\u00e8s de chez vous<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e87374d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e87374d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Des services de qualit\u00e9, pr\u00e8s de chez vous\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d87565 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6d87565\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Les\u00a0<b>entreprises de travail adapt\u00e9 (ETA)<\/b>\u00a0proposent une large gamme de services accessibles aux particuliers : entretien d\u2019espaces verts, petits travaux, blanchisserie, conditionnement, recyclage ou encore services de proximit\u00e9.<\/p><p>Implant\u00e9es localement en Wallonie, les ETA sont des entreprises professionnelles qui garantissent un travail soign\u00e9, fiable et encadr\u00e9. Elles mettent un point d\u2019honneur \u00e0 offrir un\u00a0<b>service de qualit\u00e9<\/b>, adapt\u00e9 \u00e0 vos besoins et r\u00e9alis\u00e9 dans le respect des d\u00e9lais.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2312051 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2312051\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8996a1a elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"8996a1a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/annuaire-eta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Annuaire des ETA<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dde0930 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"dde0930\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/secteur\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Secteurs<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd032fb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fd032fb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e2dfce e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6e2dfce\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a45d1a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2a45d1a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-07b216c elementor-arrows-position-outside elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-carousel\" data-id=\"07b216c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;slides_to_show&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;navigation&quot;:&quot;arrows&quot;,&quot;image_spacing_custom&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_hover&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_interaction&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;autoplay_speed&quot;:5000,&quot;infinite&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:500,&quot;image_spacing_custom_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;image_spacing_custom_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"image-carousel.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div 