ir une ETA, c\u2019est faire le choix :<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47c2e1c e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"47c2e1c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3108926 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3108926\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0946603 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0946603\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-066d09c elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"066d09c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-trophy\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M552 64H448V24c0-13.3-10.7-24-24-24H152c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24v40H24C10.7 64 0 74.7 0 88v56c0 35.7 22.5 72.4 61.9 100.7 31.5 22.7 69.8 37.1 110 41.7C203.3 338.5 240 360 240 360v72h-48c-35.3 0-64 20.7-64 56v12c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h296c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12v-12c0-35.3-28.7-56-64-56h-48v-72s36.7-21.5 68.1-73.6c40.3-4.6 78.6-19 110-41.7 39.3-28.3 61.9-65 61.9-100.7V88c0-13.3-10.7-24-24-24zM99.3 192.8C74.9 175.2 64 155.6 64 144v-16h64.2c1 32.6 5.8 61.2 12.8 86.2-15.1-5.2-29.2-12.4-41.7-21.4zM512 144c0 16.1-17.7 36.1-35.3 48.8-12.5 9-26.7 16.2-41.8 21.4 7-25 11.8-53.6 12.8-86.2H512v16z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUn prestataire performant\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-354f499 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"354f499\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a961731 elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"a961731\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-smile-beam\" viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M248 8C111 8 0 119 0 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S385 8 248 8zm0 448c-110.3 0-200-89.7-200-200S137.7 56 248 56s200 89.7 200 200-89.7 200-200 200zm84-143.4c-20.8 25-51.5 39.4-84 39.4s-63.2-14.3-84-39.4c-8.5-10.2-23.6-11.5-33.8-3.1-10.2 8.5-11.5 23.6-3.1 33.8 30 36 74.1 56.6 120.9 56.6s90.9-20.6 120.9-56.6c8.5-10.2 7.1-25.3-3.1-33.8-10.2-8.4-25.3-7.1-33.8 3.1zM136.5 211c7.7-13.7 19.2-21.6 31.5-21.6s23.8 7.9 31.5 21.6l9.5 17c2.1 3.7 6.2 4.7 9.3 3.7 3.6-1.1 6-4.5 5.7-8.3-3.3-42.1-32.2-71.4-56-71.4s-52.7 29.3-56 71.4c-.3 3.7 2.1 7.2 5.7 8.3 3.4 1.1 7.4-.5 9.3-3.7l9.5-17zM328 152c-23.8 0-52.7 29.3-56 71.4-.3 3.7 2.1 7.2 5.7 8.3 3.5 1.1 7.4-.5 9.3-3.7l9.5-17c7.7-13.7 19.2-21.6 31.5-21.6s23.8 7.9 31.5 21.6l9.5 17c2.1 3.7 6.2 4.7 9.3 3.7 3.6-1.1 6-4.5 5.7-8.3-3.3-42.1-32.2-71.4-56-71.4z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUn impact social concret\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8b2df2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c8b2df2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b41d452 elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"b41d452\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-store-alt\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M320 384H128V224H64v256c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32h256c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32V224h-64v160zm314.6-241.8l-85.3-128c-6-8.9-16-14.2-26.7-14.2H117.4c-10.7 0-20.7 5.3-26.6 14.2l-85.3 128c-14.2 21.3 1 49.8 26.6 49.8H608c25.5 0 40.7-28.5 26.6-49.8zM512 496c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h32c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16V224h-64v272z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tun ancrage local fort\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a3ed701 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a3ed701\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>C\u2019est d\u00e9montrer qu\u2019il est possible de concilier efficacit\u00e9 des services publics et responsabilit\u00e9 soci\u00e9tale.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-697f9a9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"697f9a9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-213133f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"213133f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4373c52 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4373c52\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAQ sp\u00e9cifique<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0542c3e elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion\" data-id=\"0542c3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;all_collapsed&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"nested-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-n-accordion\" aria-label=\"Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-5510\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-5510\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Les ETA proposent-elles des vrais contrats de travail ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-5510\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcecaae e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"dcecaae\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0eccde elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e0eccde\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Oui.<\/strong> Les travailleurs en ETA b\u00e9n\u00e9ficient d&rsquo;un <strong>contrat \u00e0 dur\u00e9e ind\u00e9termin\u00e9e (CDI)<\/strong>, d&rsquo;un <strong>salaire respectant les bar\u00e8mes<\/strong> en vigueur, et d&rsquo;une <strong>protection sociale compl\u00e8te<\/strong>.<\/p><p>Le poste est adapt\u00e9 aux besoins de chaque personne : am\u00e9nagement du poste, rythme, outils, environnement. Un accompagnement psychosocial est \u00e9galement assur\u00e9 au quotidien.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e89b35b elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"e89b35b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/travailler-en-eta\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Voir ce que les ETA offrent \u00e0 leurs travailleurs<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-5511\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-5511\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Quels types de services peut-on confier \u00e0 une ETA ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-5511\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5be3d4b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5be3d4b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6459899 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6459899\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Les ETA couvrent une <strong>large palette de secteurs<\/strong> : espaces verts, nettoyage et blanchisserie, conditionnement et logistique, menuiserie, construction, imprimerie, alimentation et restauration, montage technique, soutien administratif, textile, travail du m\u00e9tal\u2026<\/p><p>Certaines interviennent dans des <strong>domaines \u00e0 hauts standards<\/strong> comme l&rsquo;industrie pharmaceutique ou l&rsquo;a\u00e9ronautique.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afa2890 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"afa2890\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/secteur\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir tous les secteurs d'activit\u00e9<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-5512\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-5512\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Le recours \u00e0 une ETA permet-il de remplir des obligations l\u00e9gales en mati\u00e8re d'emploi de personnes en situation de handicap ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-5512\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9a5654 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b9a5654\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c78a57f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c78a57f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Oui.<\/strong> Pour les pouvoirs publics, la valorisation est encadr\u00e9e l\u00e9galement : en Wallonie et \u00e0 Bruxelles, <strong>jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 50 % de l&rsquo;obligation l\u00e9gale d&#8217;emploi<\/strong> peut \u00eatre rencontr\u00e9e via des march\u00e9s confi\u00e9s \u00e0 des ETA (calcul\u00e9s en ETP sur base du montant du march\u00e9). Au niveau f\u00e9d\u00e9ral, jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 un tiers de l&rsquo;obligation peut \u00eatre couverte de cette fa\u00e7on.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-316635c elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"316635c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/pouvoirs-publics\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Tout savoir sur les march\u00e9s publics et les ETA<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-5513\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-5513\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Une administration peut-elle int\u00e9grer les ETA dans ses march\u00e9s publics ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-5513\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-970aa36 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"970aa36\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac0b6d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ac0b6d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Oui<\/strong>, et<strong> des outils juridiques existent pour le faire concr\u00e8tement<\/strong> :<\/p><ul><li>r\u00e9servation de march\u00e9s ou de lots \u00e0 des structures d&rsquo;\u00e9conomie sociale d&rsquo;insertion<\/li><li>insertion de clauses sociales dans les cahiers des charges<\/li><li>allotissement r\u00e9fl\u00e9chi pour faciliter la candidature des ETA.<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Ces m\u00e9canismes permettent de <strong>transformer une obligation l\u00e9gale en levier d&rsquo;action publique responsable<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9c5634 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"f9c5634\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/pouvoirs-publics\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir les outils pour les pouvoirs publics<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-5514\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-5514\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Les ETA sont-elles pr\u00e9sentes dans toute la Wallonie ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-5514\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1376620 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1376620\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-355d4f3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"355d4f3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Oui.<\/strong> Les ETA sont r\u00e9parties sur l&rsquo;ensemble de la <strong>R\u00e9gion wallonne<\/strong> et de la <strong>Communaut\u00e9 germanophone<\/strong>. Leurs services sont non-d\u00e9localisables, ancr\u00e9s dans leur territoire, avec une r\u00e9activit\u00e9 et une proximit\u00e9 que les prestataires ext\u00e9rieurs ne peuvent pas offrir.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-badbcef elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"badbcef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/pouvoirs-publics\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Consulter l'annuaire des ETA<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-5515\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"6\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-5515\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Qu'est-ce qu'EWETA ? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-5515\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa295f0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fa295f0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-86ce8b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"86ce8b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>EWETA est la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonne des Entreprises de Travail Adapt\u00e9.<\/strong> Elle repr\u00e9sente et soutient les ETA de Wallonie et de la Communaut\u00e9 germanophone, d\u00e9fend leurs int\u00e9r\u00eats aupr\u00e8s des pouvoirs publics, et g\u00e8re ce site web, qui est le point d&rsquo;entr\u00e9e centralis\u00e9 pour <a href=\"\/annuaire-eta\">trouver une ETA<\/a>, <a href=\"\/secteur\">d\u00e9couvrir les secteurs d&rsquo;activit\u00e9<\/a> et <a href=\"\/pouvoirs-publics\">comprendre le cadre l\u00e9gal du secteur<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application\/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Les ETA proposent-elles des vrais contrats de travail ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Oui. Les travailleurs en ETA b\\u00e9n\\u00e9ficient d&rsquo;un contrat \\u00e0 dur\\u00e9e ind\\u00e9termin\\u00e9e (CDI), d&rsquo;un salaire respectant les bar\\u00e8mes en vigueur, et d&rsquo;une protection sociale compl\\u00e8te.Le poste est adapt\\u00e9 aux besoins de chaque personne : am\\u00e9nagement du poste, rythme, outils, environnement. Un accompagnement psychosocial est \\u00e9galement assur\\u00e9 au quotidien.\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tVoir ce que les ETA offrent \\u00e0 leurs travailleurs\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Quels types de services peut-on confier \\u00e0 une ETA ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Les ETA couvrent une large palette de secteurs : espaces verts, nettoyage et blanchisserie, conditionnement et logistique, menuiserie, construction, imprimerie, alimentation et restauration, montage technique, soutien administratif, textile, travail du m\\u00e9tal\\u2026Certaines interviennent dans des domaines \\u00e0 hauts standards comme l&rsquo;industrie pharmaceutique ou l&rsquo;a\\u00e9ronautique.\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tD\\u00e9couvrir tous les secteurs d'activit\\u00e9\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Le recours \\u00e0 une ETA permet-il de remplir des obligations l\\u00e9gales en mati\\u00e8re d'emploi de personnes en situation de handicap ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Oui. Pour les pouvoirs publics, la valorisation est encadr\\u00e9e l\\u00e9galement : en Wallonie et \\u00e0 Bruxelles, jusqu&rsquo;\\u00e0 50 % de l&rsquo;obligation l\\u00e9gale d&#8217;emploi peut \\u00eatre rencontr\\u00e9e via des march\\u00e9s confi\\u00e9s \\u00e0 des ETA (calcul\\u00e9s en ETP sur base du montant du march\\u00e9). Au niveau f\\u00e9d\\u00e9ral, jusqu&rsquo;\\u00e0 un tiers de l&rsquo;obligation peut \\u00eatre couverte de cette fa\\u00e7on.\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tTout savoir sur les march\\u00e9s publics et les ETA\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Une administration peut-elle int\\u00e9grer les ETA dans ses march\\u00e9s publics ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Oui, et des outils juridiques existent pour le faire concr\\u00e8tement :r\\u00e9servation de march\\u00e9s ou de lots \\u00e0 des structures d&rsquo;\\u00e9conomie sociale d&rsquo;insertioninsertion de clauses sociales dans les cahiers des chargesallotissement r\\u00e9fl\\u00e9chi pour faciliter la candidature des ETA.\\u00a0Ces m\\u00e9canismes permettent de transformer une obligation l\\u00e9gale en levier d&rsquo;action publique responsable.\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tD\\u00e9couvrir les outils pour les pouvoirs publics\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Les ETA sont-elles pr\\u00e9sentes dans toute la Wallonie ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Oui. Les ETA sont r\\u00e9parties sur l&rsquo;ensemble de la R\\u00e9gion wallonne et de la Communaut\\u00e9 germanophone. Leurs services sont non-d\\u00e9localisables, ancr\\u00e9s dans leur territoire, avec une r\\u00e9activit\\u00e9 et une proximit\\u00e9 que les prestataires ext\\u00e9rieurs ne peuvent pas offrir.\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tConsulter l'annuaire des ETA\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Qu'est-ce qu'EWETA ?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"EWETA est la F\\u00e9d\\u00e9ration Wallonne des Entreprises de Travail Adapt\\u00e9. Elle repr\\u00e9sente et soutient les ETA de Wallonie et de la Communaut\\u00e9 germanophone, d\\u00e9fend leurs int\\u00e9r\\u00eats aupr\\u00e8s des pouvoirs publics, et g\\u00e8re ce site web, qui est le point d&rsquo;entr\\u00e9e centralis\\u00e9 pour trouver une ETA, d\\u00e9couvrir les secteurs d&rsquo;activit\\u00e9 et comprendre le cadre l\\u00e9gal du secteur.\"}}]}<\/script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Collaborer avec une ETA en Wallonie Faites appel \u00e0 une Entreprise de travail adapt\u00e9 (ETA) pr\u00e8s de chez vous Entreprise Sous-traitance sociale, RSE, insourcing Annuaire des ETA Secteurs En savoir plus Particulier Pour tout service de proximit\u00e9, tel que jardin, blanchisserie, artisanat, &#8230; Annuaire des ETA Secteurs En savoir plus Un futur travailleur Travailler en [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":62,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5264950","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5264950","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/62"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5264950"}],"version-history":[{"count":103,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5264950\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5266759,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5264950\/revisions\/5266759"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5264950"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":5263426,"date":"2026-04-10T09:20:13","date_gmt":"2026-04-10T07:20:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/?page_id=5263426"},"modified":"2026-06-17T12:35:52","modified_gmt":"2026-06-17T10:35:52","slug":"je-suis-une-entreprise","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/je-suis\/je-suis-une-entreprise\/","title":{"rendered":"Une entreprise"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5263426\" class=\"elementor elementor-5263426\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4aa4a33 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4aa4a33\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec17a09 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ec17a09\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e618e68 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e618e68\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Sous-traiter \u00e0 une entreprise de travail adapt\u00e9 en Wallonie (ETA)<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cad11dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cad11dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Je suis une entreprise<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fc90173 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3fc90173\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d877765 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d877765\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fb19a0d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3fb19a0d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-789fb5ca e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"789fb5ca\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-76930899 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"76930899\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Un partenaire professionnel et flexible<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f56107 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"5f56107\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-610d260 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"610d260\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pour les <\/span><b>entreprises priv\u00e9es<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, les ETA constituent des <\/span><b>partenaires de sous-traitance fiables<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, flexibles et r\u00e9actifs, capables de s\u2019int\u00e9grer dans une cha\u00eene de valeur existante ou de prendre en charge des activit\u00e9s sp\u00e9cifiques, dans le respect des d\u00e9lais, des normes de qualit\u00e9 et des exigences op\u00e9rationnelles.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Elles interviennent dans de nombreux secteurs : logistique, conditionnement, assemblage, nettoyage industriel, espaces verts, maintenance, imprimerie, etc.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des \u00e9quipes form\u00e9es et des infrastructures adapt\u00e9es, les ETA garantissent des prestations fiables, structur\u00e9es et comp\u00e9titives.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21d97884 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"21d97884\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/secteur\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir les services et produits<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b73456e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6b73456e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1af97a4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1af97a4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/ETA123-AP-Beauraing-Manutention-rke61g5ecovpl7cajt9htex742x1r96uk9p7e7uvxk.jpg\" title=\"ETA123 AP Beauraing \u2013 Manutention\" alt=\"Manutention - ETA123 AP Beauraing\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">ETA123 AP Beauraing<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d4b19f2 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-absolute elementor-mobile-position-inline-start elementor-shape-circle elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"d4b19f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-paper-plane\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M440 6.5L24 246.4c-34.4 19.9-31.1 70.8 5.7 85.9L144 379.6V464c0 46.4 59.2 65.5 86.6 28.6l43.8-59.1 111.9 46.2c5.9 2.4 12.1 3.6 18.3 3.6 8.2 0 16.3-2.1 23.6-6.2 12.8-7.2 21.6-20 23.9-34.5l59.4-387.2c6.1-40.1-36.9-68.8-71.5-48.9zM192 464v-64.6l36.6 15.1L192 464zm212.6-28.7l-153.8-63.5L391 169.5c10.7-15.5-9.5-33.5-23.7-21.2L155.8 332.6 48 288 464 48l-59.4 387.3z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLes entreprises de travail adapt\u00e9 (ETA) sont des acteurs \u00e9conomiques \u00e0 part enti\u00e8re, sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s dans la sous-traitance pour les entreprises.\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-586a094 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"586a094\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5d237d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e5d237d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8955580 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8955580\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f3d4cda elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f3d4cda\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Elles offrent <\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68118b0 elementor-align-start elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"68118b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-double-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">une qualit\u00e9 constante<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-double-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\"> le respect des d\u00e9lais<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-double-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">une capacit\u00e9 d\u2019adaptation \u00e0 vos processus industriels<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-double-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">un encadrement professionnel<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c690144 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c690144\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">De nombreuses entreprises font d\u00e9j\u00e0 confiance aux ETA pour externaliser certaines activit\u00e9s, <strong>pourquoi pas vous ?\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f8c976 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5f8c976\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf417ba e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bf417ba\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a549507 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a549507\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Performance, qualit\u00e9 et certifications\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16ce80a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"16ce80a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Les ETA r\u00e9pondent aux exigences du march\u00e9 en mati\u00e8re de qualit\u00e9 et de productivit\u00e9. <br \/>Beaucoup disposent de <\/span><b>certifications (ISO, qualit\u00e9, s\u00e9curit\u00e9)<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et appliquent des proc\u00e9dures rigoureuses.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c9f9a84 e-con-full elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c9f9a84\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8249239 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8249239\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Metalgroup-5-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5265755\" alt=\"T\u00f4lerie - Metalgroup\" srcset=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Metalgroup-5-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Metalgroup-5-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Metalgroup-5-768x513.jpg 768w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Metalgroup-5.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4972ed e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c4972ed\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bca894e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bca894e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e34b7b1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e34b7b1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68cfc02 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"68cfc02\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Axedis-86-rnhigfrapn2hb9mmod6eb5m0azsdasu047uofqnfcg.jpg\" title=\"Axedis logistique\" alt=\"Axedis\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Axedis<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ae034f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ae034f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Un renforcement de vos \u00e9quipes<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52aae39 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"52aae39\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Les ETA proposent \u00e9galement des <\/span><b>contrats d\u2019entreprises<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, dispositif particulier \u00e0 notre secteur qui permet aux ETA de r\u00e9aliser des prestations directement sur le site du client, via une \u00e9quipe d\u00e9di\u00e9e, organis\u00e9e et encadr\u00e9e par l\u2019ETA. Une solution professionnelle, flexible et s\u00e9curis\u00e9e pour externaliser certaines activit\u00e9s tout en conservant une parfaite int\u00e9gration op\u00e9rationnelle.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5aabd1 elementor-mobile-align-right elementor-tablet-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"d5aabd1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/secteur\/contrat-dentreprises-insourcing\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir les contrats d'entreprise<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a99b15d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a99b15d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-024b9cf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"024b9cf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-772475c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"772475c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Un levier pour accompagner votre croissance\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-63787fb7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"63787fb7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Les ETA constituent un v\u00e9ritable atout pour :<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">absorber des pics de production<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">externaliser certaines t\u00e2ches<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">accompagner une strat\u00e9gie de <\/span><b>scaling up<\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">gagner en flexibilit\u00e9 op\u00e9rationnelle<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Elles s\u2019int\u00e8grent facilement dans vos cha\u00eenes de valeur et s\u2019adaptent \u00e0 vos contraintes techniques et organisationnelles.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed92b1e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ed92b1e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ebfcd2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8ebfcd2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-307e52e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"307e52e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d2a4d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4d2a4d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Pourquoi choisir une ETA comme sous-traitant ?\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff12336 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ff12336\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d62533c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d62533c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84ec995 elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"84ec995\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-certificate\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M458.622 255.92l45.985-45.005