 ETA<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5b726292 elementor-mobile-align-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"5b726292\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/secteur\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Rechercher par secteur d'activit\u00e9<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Sous-traiter \u00e0 une entreprise de travail adapt\u00e9 en Wallonie (ETA) Je suis une entreprise Un partenaire professionnel et flexible Pour les entreprises priv\u00e9es, les ETA constituent des partenaires de sous-traitance fiables, flexibles et r\u00e9actifs, capables de s\u2019int\u00e9grer dans une cha\u00eene de valeur existante ou de prendre en charge des activit\u00e9s sp\u00e9cifiques, dans le respect des [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":62,"featured_media":0,"parent":5264950,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5263426","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5263426","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/62"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5263426"}],"version-history":[{"count":128,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5263426\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5267620,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5263426\/revisions\/5267620"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5264950"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5263426"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":5263411,"date":"2026-04-10T08:56:03","date_gmt":"2026-04-10T06:56:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/?page_id=5263411"},"modified":"2026-06-17T12:36:03","modified_gmt":"2026-06-17T10:36:03","slug":"je-suis-un-particulier","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/je-suis\/je-suis-un-particulier\/","title":{"rendered":"Un particulier"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5263411\" class=\"elementor elementor-5263411\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fce60e5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"fce60e5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-330172b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"330172b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1aa770 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d1aa770\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Faire appel \u00e0 une Entreprise de travail adapt\u00e9 (ETA)<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f86e66c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f86e66c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Je suis un particulier<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e665e17 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e665e17\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d390d4e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d390d4e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9dd1251 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9dd1251\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd779df e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cd779df\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27b3541 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"27b3541\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Des services de qualit\u00e9, pr\u00e8s de chez vous\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e535c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"8e535c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9c71ca elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f9c71ca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Les <\/span><b>entreprises de travail adapt\u00e9 (ETA)<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> proposent une large gamme de services accessibles aux particuliers : entretien d\u2019espaces verts, petits travaux, blanchisserie, conditionnement, recyclage ou encore services de proximit\u00e9.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Implant\u00e9es localement en Wallonie, les ETA sont des entreprises professionnelles qui garantissent un travail soign\u00e9, fiable et encadr\u00e9. Elles mettent un point d\u2019honneur \u00e0 offrir un <\/span><b>service de qualit\u00e9<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, adapt\u00e9 \u00e0 vos besoins et r\u00e9alis\u00e9 dans le respect des d\u00e9lais.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd84e8e elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"fd84e8e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/annuaire-eta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir les enteprises<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f5c21f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0f5c21f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80f5e2e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"80f5e2e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Canva-Couture-menagere-1-rkef27dzm1g4v3m476v6agofqm8f6kg97nyihuc65k.png\" title=\"Canva \u2013 Couture me\u0301nage\u0300re\" alt=\"Couture m\u00e9nag\u00e8re - Canva\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9ad177 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-absolute elementor-mobile-position-inline-start elementor-shape-circle elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"b9ad177\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-paper-plane\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M440 6.5L24 246.4c-34.4 19.9-31.1 70.8 5.7 85.9L144 379.6V464c0 46.4 59.2 65.5 86.6 28.6l43.8-59.1 111.9 46.2c5.9 2.4 12.1 3.6 18.3 3.6 8.2 0 16.3-2.1 23.6-6.2 12.8-7.2 21.6-20 23.9-34.5l59.4-387.2c6.1-40.1-36.9-68.8-71.5-48.9zM192 464v-64.6l36.6 15.1L192 464zm212.6-28.7l-153.8-63.5L391 169.5c10.7-15.5-9.5-33.5-23.7-21.2L155.8 332.6 48 288 464 48l-59.4 387.3z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDes entreprises pr\u00e8s de chez vous pour vos projets et pour l'emploi\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4bce3a8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4bce3a8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b75943 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2b75943\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac9c641 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ac9c641\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9035f4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d9035f4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Un choix qui a du sens\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7251479 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7251479\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section-header\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Faire appel \u00e0 une ETA, ce n\u2019est pas seulement choisir un prestataire : c\u2019est aussi soutenir un mod\u00e8le d\u2019<\/span><b>\u00e9conomie sociale<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Les entreprises de travail adapt\u00e9 ont pour mission de cr\u00e9er de l\u2019emploi durable pour des <\/span><b>personnes en situation de handicap<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, en valorisant leurs comp\u00e9tences dans un environnement de travail adapt\u00e9 et inclusif.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fccd82f elementor-mobile-align-right elementor-tablet-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"fccd82f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/annuaire-eta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir les ETA<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4332d09 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4332d09\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f2f1b15 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f2f1b15\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i