z vous Les entreprises de travail adapt\u00e9 (ETA) proposent une large gamme de services accessibles aux particuliers : entretien d\u2019espaces verts, petits travaux, blanchisserie, conditionnement, recyclage ou encore services de proximit\u00e9. Implant\u00e9es localement en Wallonie, les [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":62,"featured_media":0,"parent":5264950,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5263411","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5263411","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/62"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5263411"}],"version-history":[{"count":93,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5263411\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5267623,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5263411\/revisions\/5267623"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5264950"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5263411"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":5260061,"date":"2026-01-15T10:04:41","date_gmt":"2026-01-15T09:04:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/?page_id=5260061"},"modified":"2026-06-04T16:39:01","modified_gmt":"2026-06-04T14:39:01","slug":"charte-vie-privee","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/charte-vie-privee\/","title":{"rendered":"Charte Vie Priv\u00e9e"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5260061\" class=\"elementor elementor-5260061\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-74eaaaa5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"74eaaaa5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1056b862 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1056b862\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-395583b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"395583b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Charte sur la vie priv\u00e9e<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35444795 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"35444795\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"singlearticle\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24732b7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"24732b7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bef941d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bef941d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">1. Pourquoi cette charte vie priv\u00e9e ?<\/h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Eweta \u2013 F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonne des Entreprises de Travail Adapt\u00e9 ASBL accorde beaucoup d&rsquo;importance \u00e0 la protection de votre vie priv\u00e9e et de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles. Nous collectons et traitons vos donn\u00e9es personnelles conform\u00e9ment aux dispositions l\u00e9gales applicables en la mati\u00e8re, \u00e0 savoir la Loi du 8 d\u00e9cembre 1992 relative \u00e0 la protection de la vie priv\u00e9e \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9gard des traitements de donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel (\u00ab Loi vie priv\u00e9e \u00bb) et le R\u00e8glement europ\u00e9en du 27 avril 2016 relatif \u00e0 la protection des personnes physiques \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9gard du traitement des donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel et \u00e0 la libre circulation de ces donn\u00e9es (\u00ab R\u00e8glement \u00bb).<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Nous souhaitons vous informer des \u00e9ventuelles op\u00e9rations de traitement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles et de vos droits \u00e0 cet \u00e9gard. En utilisant nos sites internet <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"http:\/\/www.leseta.be\">www.leseta.be<\/a> et <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"http:\/\/www.eweta.be\">www.eweta.be<\/a>, vous acceptez express\u00e9ment la collecte et le traitement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles par Eweta de la mani\u00e8re d\u00e9crite dans ce document.<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Nous nous r\u00e9servons le droit d&rsquo;apporter \u00e0 tout moment des modifications \u00e0 notre Charte vie priv\u00e9e. Toute modification substantielle sera toujours communiqu\u00e9e clairement sur nos sites. Nous vous conseillons n\u00e9anmoins de consulter r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement ce document.<\/p><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">2. Qui traite vos donn\u00e9es personnelles ?<\/h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Eweta est responsable des sites <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"http:\/\/www.leseta.be\">www.leseta.be<\/a> et <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"http:\/\/www.eweta.be\">www.eweta.be<\/a>.<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Informations de contact :<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-pre-wrap leading-[1.7]\">Eweta \u2013 F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonne des Entreprises de Travail Adapt\u00e9 ASBL <br \/>Route de Philippeville, 196 <br \/>6010 Couillet Belgique<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Num\u00e9ro d&rsquo;entreprise (TVA-BE) : BE 0418 788 788 <br \/>E-mail : <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"mailto:info@eweta.be\">info@eweta.be<\/a> <br \/>T\u00e9l\u00e9phone : 071\/29 89 20<\/p><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">3. Quelles donn\u00e9es personnelles sont collect\u00e9es ?<\/h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Le traitement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles est limit\u00e9 au strict n\u00e9cessaire pour atteindre les finalit\u00e9s poursuivies par Eweta. Ci-dessous, sont \u00e9num\u00e9r\u00e9es les cat\u00e9gories de donn\u00e9es concern\u00e9es par le traitement.<\/p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Donn\u00e9es d&rsquo;identification<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Donn\u00e9es relatives \u00e0 la connexion (adresse IP, etc.)<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Donn\u00e9es de localisation<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Caract\u00e9ristiques personnelles<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Habitudes de consommation<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Donn\u00e9es relatives aux \u00e9tudes et \u00e0 la formation<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Donn\u00e9es relatives \u00e0 l&#8217;emploi et \u00e0 la fonction<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">4. Quelles sont les finalit\u00e9s poursuivies ?<\/h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Eweta recueille vos donn\u00e9es personnelles dans le seul objectif de vous fournir une exp\u00e9rience d&rsquo;utilisation optimale, personnalis\u00e9e et en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9 sur ses sites <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"http:\/\/www.leseta.be\">www.leseta.be<\/a> et <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"http:\/\/www.eweta.be\">www.eweta.be<\/a>. La collecte de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles peut s&rsquo;intensifier de par une utilisation plus intensive de nos sites.<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Le traitement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles est donc essentiel au bon fonctionnement de nos sites et \u00e0 la fourniture de nos services. Eweta s&rsquo;engage \u00e0 traiter vos donn\u00e9es personnelles exclusivement aux fins suivantes :<\/p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Permettre la mise en relation entre entreprises et Entreprises de Travail Adapt\u00e9 via l&rsquo;annuaire<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">G\u00e9rer la relation contractuelle<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Offrir \u00e0 l&rsquo;utilisateur un service g\u00e9n\u00e9ral mais aussi personnalis\u00e9, incluant l&rsquo;envoi d&rsquo;informations utiles, de newsletters, la fourniture de soutien et le suivi des demandes<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Am\u00e9liorer et personnaliser nos services<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">D\u00e9tecter les fraudes, les erreurs et les comportements criminels<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Envoyer des offres ou communications si vous y avez express\u00e9ment consenti (marketing direct). Dans ce cas, vous restez libre de retirer votre consentement \u00e0 tout moment<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">En visitant nos sites, certaines donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es \u00e0 des fins statistiques. Ces donn\u00e9es nous permettent d&rsquo;optimiser votre exp\u00e9rience d&rsquo;utilisation. Il s&rsquo;agit de votre adresse IP, de la zone g\u00e9ographique de consultation, du jour et de l&rsquo;heure de consultation, et des pages consult\u00e9es. En visitant nos sites, vous acceptez express\u00e9ment la collecte de ces donn\u00e9es \u00e0 des fins statistiques.<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Vos donn\u00e9es personnelles sont destin\u00e9es \u00e0 \u00eatre utilis\u00e9es exclusivement \u00e0 des fins internes. Vos donn\u00e9es personnelles ne seront donc pas vendues, donn\u00e9es ou transmises \u00e0 des tiers, sauf consentement pr\u00e9alable de votre part. Eweta a pris toutes les mesures techniques et organisationnelles possibles pour \u00e9viter une violation des donn\u00e9es.<\/p><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">5. Nous utilisons aussi des cookies !<\/h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Lors de votre visite sur nos sites, des cookies peuvent \u00eatre plac\u00e9s sur le disque dur de votre ordinateur. Nous utilisons des cookies pour offrir une exp\u00e9rience d&rsquo;utilisation optimale \u00e0 nos visiteurs r\u00e9guliers.<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Pour plus d&rsquo;informations sur l&rsquo;utilisation que nous faisons des cookies, nous vous invitons \u00e0 consulter notre Politique des cookies.<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Si vous visitez nos sites, nous vous conseillons d&rsquo;activer vos cookies. Toutefois, vous restez libre de les d\u00e9sactiver via les param\u00e8tres de votre navigateur si vous le souhaitez.<\/p><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">6. Quels sont mes droits ?<\/h2><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\">6.1. Garantie d&rsquo;un traitement loyal et licite<\/h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Vos donn\u00e9es personnelles sont toujours trait\u00e9es conform\u00e9ment aux fins l\u00e9gitimes explicit\u00e9es au point 4. Elles sont collect\u00e9es et trait\u00e9es de mani\u00e8re ad\u00e9quate, pertinente et non-excessive, et ne sont pas conserv\u00e9es plus longtemps que n\u00e9cessaire pour atteindre les finalit\u00e9s poursuivies.<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Toutes les mesures techniques et s\u00e9curitaires ont \u00e9t\u00e9 prises pour limiter au maximum les risques d&rsquo;acc\u00e8s ou de traitement ill\u00e9gal ou non-autoris\u00e9 de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles. En cas d&rsquo;intrusion dans ses syst\u00e8mes informatiques, Eweta prendra imm\u00e9diatement toutes les mesures n\u00e9cessaires pour r\u00e9duire les dommages \u00e0 leur minimum.<\/p><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\">6.2. Droit d&rsquo;acc\u00e8s<\/h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Si vous \u00eates en mesure de prouver votre identit\u00e9, vous avez le droit d&rsquo;obtenir des informations sur le traitement de vos donn\u00e9es. Ainsi vous avez le droit de conna\u00eetre les finalit\u00e9s du traitement, les cat\u00e9gories de donn\u00e9es concern\u00e9es, les cat\u00e9gories de destinataires auxquels les donn\u00e9es sont transmises, les crit\u00e8res utilis\u00e9s pour d\u00e9terminer la dur\u00e9e de conservation des donn\u00e9es, et les droits que vous pouvez exercer sur vos donn\u00e9es.<\/p><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\">6.3. Droit de rectification<\/h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Les donn\u00e9es personnelles inexactes ou incompl\u00e8tes peuvent \u00eatre corrig\u00e9es. Vous pouvez nous en faire la demande \u00e9crite.<\/p><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\">6.4. Droit \u00e0 l&rsquo;effacement (ou \u00ab droit \u00e0 l&rsquo;oubli \u00bb)<\/h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Vous avez en outre le droit d&rsquo;obtenir l&rsquo;effacement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles dans les hypoth\u00e8ses suivantes :<\/p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Vos donn\u00e9es personnelles ne sont plus n\u00e9cessaires au regard des finalit\u00e9s ;<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Vous retirez votre consentement au traitement et il n&rsquo;existe pas d&rsquo;autre fondement l\u00e9gal au traitement ;<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Vous avez valablement exerc\u00e9 votre droit d&rsquo;opposition ;<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Vos donn\u00e9es ont fait l&rsquo;objet d&rsquo;un traitement ill\u00e9gal ;<\/li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Vos donn\u00e9es doivent \u00eatre supprim\u00e9es pour respecter une obligation l\u00e9gale.<\/li><\/ul><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\">6.5. Droit \u00e0 la limitation du traitement<\/h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Dans certaines hypoth\u00e8ses, vous avez le droit de demander la limitation du traitement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles, notamment en cas de contestation quant \u00e0 l&rsquo;exactitude des donn\u00e9es, si vos donn\u00e9es ont \u00e9t\u00e9 trait\u00e9es ill\u00e9galement, si les donn\u00e9es sont n\u00e9cessaires dans le cadre d&rsquo;une proc\u00e9dure judiciaire ou le temps n\u00e9cessaire \u00e0 Eweta pour v\u00e9rifier que vous pouvez valablement exercer votre droit \u00e0 l&rsquo;effacement.<\/p><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\">6.6. Droit d&rsquo;opposition<\/h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Vous avez en outre le droit de vous opposer \u00e0 tout moment au traitement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles. Eweta cessera le traitement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles, \u00e0 moins qu&rsquo;elle ne parvienne \u00e0 d\u00e9montrer qu&rsquo;il existe des motifs l\u00e9gitimes imp\u00e9rieux en faveur du traitement qui pr\u00e9valent sur votre droit d&rsquo;opposition.<\/p><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\">6.7. Droit \u00e0 la portabilit\u00e9 des donn\u00e9es<\/h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Vous avez le droit d&rsquo;obtenir toutes les donn\u00e9es personnelles que vous nous avez fournies dans un format structur\u00e9, couramment utilis\u00e9 et lisible par machine. \u00c0 votre demande, ces donn\u00e9es peuvent \u00eatre transf\u00e9r\u00e9es \u00e0 un autre prestataire, \u00e0 moins que cela soit techniquement impossible.<\/p><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\">6.8. Droit du retrait de votre consentement<\/h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Vous pouvez retirer \u00e0 tout moment votre consentement au traitement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles. Le retrait de votre consentement n&rsquo;entache pas la validit\u00e9 des op\u00e9rations de traitement ant\u00e9rieures au retrait.<\/p><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">7. Comment exercer mes droits ?<\/h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Pour exercer vos droits, vous devez nous envoyer une demande par courrier recommand\u00e9 \u00e0 l&rsquo;adresse suivante :<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Eweta \u2013 F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonne des Entreprises de Travail Adapt\u00e9 ASBL<\/strong> Route de Philippeville, 196 \u2014 6010 Couillet<\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Ou par e-mail \u00e0 : <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"mailto:info@eweta.be\">info@eweta.be<\/a><\/p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Nous y r\u00e9pondrons dans les meilleurs d\u00e9lais, et au plus tard un (1) mois apr\u00e8s r\u00e9ception de la demande.<\/p><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">8. Possibilit\u00e9 d&rsquo;introduire une plainte<\/h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Si vous n&rsquo;\u00eates pas satisfait du traitement de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles par Eweta, vous avez le droit d&rsquo;introduire une plainte aupr\u00e8s de l&rsquo;Autorit\u00e9 de Protection des Donn\u00e9es (APD) : <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/www.autoriteprotectiondonnees.be\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.autoriteprotectiondonnees.be\/<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Charte sur la vie priv\u00e9e 1. Pourquoi cette charte vie priv\u00e9e ? Eweta \u2013 F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonne des Entreprises de Travail Adapt\u00e9 ASBL accorde beaucoup d&rsquo;importance \u00e0 la protection de votre vie priv\u00e9e et de vos donn\u00e9es personnelles. Nous collectons et traitons vos donn\u00e9es personnelles conform\u00e9ment aux dispositions l\u00e9gales applicables en la mati\u00e8re, \u00e0 savoir la [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":62,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5260061","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5260061","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/62"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5260061"}],"version-history":[{"count":13,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5260061\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5267017,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5260061\/revisions\/5267017"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5260061"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":5259545,"date":"2026-01-13T13:21:39","date_gmt":"2026-01-13T12:21:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/?page_id=5259545"},"modified":"2026-06-08T13:55:54","modified_gmt":"2026-06-08T11:55:54","slug":"pouvoirs-publics","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/pouvoirs-publics\/","title":{"rendered":"Les ETA pour vos march\u00e9s publics"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5259545\" class=\"elementor elementor-5259545\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19dd00f7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"19dd00f7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23135967 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"23135967\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7eb8e72d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7eb8e72d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Les ETA pour vos march\u00e9s publics<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4c1c24a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4c1c24a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid gap-4 [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0\"><div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid gap-4 [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0\"><p>Conciliez conformit\u00e9 l\u00e9gale, qualit\u00e9 de service et impact social dans vos proc\u00e9dures d&rsquo;achat public<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0d9e0b3 elementor-mobile-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"0d9e0b3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"#outils\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir les outils<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3095cd75 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3095cd75\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46d3678 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"46d3678\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2841f98b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2841f98b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ec5c695 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ec5c695\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-64574154 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"64574154\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Des quotas \u00e0 respecter, des solutions pour y r\u00e9pondre<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47bcced0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"47bcced0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Faire appel aux entreprises de travail adapt\u00e9 dans vos march\u00e9s publics n\u2019est pas simplement une option socialement responsable : c\u2019est un <\/span><b>levier strat\u00e9gique, juridiquement structur\u00e9 et op\u00e9rationnellement efficace<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> pour :<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4bf8f169 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"4bf8f169\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-double-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">respecter et valoriser vos obligations l\u00e9gales d\u2019emploi de personnes en situation de handicap, <\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-double-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier de prestataires professionnels et fiables, <\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-double-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">renforcer l\u2019impact social de vos politiques publiques, <\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-double-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">optimiser la performance globale de vos achats publics.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1364d83c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1364d83c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">En int\u00e9grant syst\u00e9matiquement les ETA dans vos proc\u00e9dures, en recourant notamment \u00e0 des r\u00e9servations de march\u00e9s ou\u00a0 des clauses sociales, vous transformez une obligation l\u00e9gale en <\/span><b>outil concret d\u2019action publique responsable<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b5d2436 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2b5d2436\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73045eff elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"73045eff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/20181218-Photographe-entreprise-CORALIECARDON-AVIQ_ENTRA-72-rgvcule7iyfdgabeqzba4rqvbfn6qtkjmv58uakrvs.jpg\" title=\"20181218-Photographe-entreprise-CORALIECARDON-AVIQ_ENTRA-72\" alt=\"20181218-Photographe-entreprise-CORALIECARDON-AVIQ_ENTRA-72\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79f9fcf6 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-absolute elementor-mobile-position-inline-start elementor-shape-circle elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"79f9fcf6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-hands-helping\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M488 192H336v56c0 39.7-32.3 72-72 72s-72-32.3-72-72V126.4l-64.9 39C107.8 176.9 96 197.8 96 220.2v47.3l-80 46.2C.7 322.5-4.6 342.1 4.3 357.4l80 138.6c8.8 15.3 28.4 20.5 43.7 11.7L231.4 448H368c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64h16c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32v-64h8c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24v-48c0-13.3-10.7-24-24-24zm147.7-37.4L555.7 16C546.9.7 527.3-4.5 512 4.3L408.6 64H306.4c-12 0-23.7 3.4-33.9 9.7L239 94.6c-9.4 5.8-15 16.1-15 27.1V248c0 22.1 17.9 40 40 40s40-17.9 40-40v-88h184c30.9 0 56 25.1 56 56v28.5l80-46.2c15.3-8.9 20.5-28.4 11.7-43.7z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTransformez vos obligations l\u00e9gales en leviers d'action publique responsable et performante.\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fcd93d7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3fcd93d7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b5f95d8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4b5f95d8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ce6ac2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1ce6ac2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dda226e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1dda226e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Pourquoi faire appel aux entreprises de travail adapt\u00e9 (ETA) dans vos march\u00e9s publics ?\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ac8685 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8ac8685\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Les ETA sont des <\/span><b>entreprises d\u2019\u00e9conomie sociale actives dans l\u2019ensemble des secteurs industriels et de services<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et capables de r\u00e9pondre efficacement \u00e0 des march\u00e9s publics exigeants.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pour une administration, recourir \u00e0 une ETA permet de <\/span><b>concilier qualit\u00e9 de service, s\u00e9curit\u00e9 juridique, efficacit\u00e9 op\u00e9rationnelle et responsabilit\u00e9 soci\u00e9tale<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, tout en donnant du sens \u00e0 la commande publique.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-275fd63 elementor-mobile-align-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"275fd63\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/annuaire-eta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir nos Entreprises<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d5d7305 e-con-full elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5d5d7305\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e0655bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6e0655bb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-264997\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6-750x500.jpg 750w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6-1080x720.jpg 1080w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6-980x653.jpg 980w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6-480x320.jpg 480w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6-240x160.jpg 240w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/6.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23e913b8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"23e913b8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7eb0619e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7eb0619e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c3843b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6c3843b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Des obligations chiffr\u00e9es en mati\u00e8re d\u2019emploi de personnes en situation de handicap\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3102b2d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3102b2d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Dans plusieurs niveaux de pouvoirs publics en Belgique, il existe une <b>obligation d\u2019emploi de personnes en situation de handicap<\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4895d19 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4895d19\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31c3eb3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"31c3eb3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9d1784 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e9d1784\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2,5 %<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6826e35 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6826e35\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Niveau wallon<\/strong><\/p><p>Dans les services publics wallons, les provinces, les communes, les CPAS et les associations de services publics, un quota de 2,5 % de travailleurs en situation de handicap doit \u00eatre employ\u00e9.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c9193c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0c9193c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-261d870 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"261d870\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3 %<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e6b9599 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e6b9599\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Niveau f\u00e9d\u00e9ral<\/strong><\/p><p>Les administrations doivent atteindre <b>un quota de 3 %<\/b> de personnes en situation de handicap dans leur personnel.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e2f683 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7e2f683\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b75ce86 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b75ce86\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">50 %<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bcc62ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bcc62ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Valorisation via march\u00e9s<\/strong><\/p><p>Certaines entit\u00e9s ont des quotas sp\u00e9cifiques.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a02383e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2a02383e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ces quotas sont des <\/span><b>objectifs l\u00e9galement \u00e9tablis<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et constituent un instrument pour accro\u00eetre l\u2019inclusion professionnelle dans les administrations.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5686c5da e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5686c5da\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36f7104b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"36f7104b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-58ff6107 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"58ff6107\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43958a87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"43958a87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Valorisation des march\u00e9s publics confi\u00e9s aux ETA<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f2a8cfa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6f2a8cfa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Une partie de l\u2019obligation l\u00e9gale d\u2019emploi peut \u00eatre <\/span><b>rencontr\u00e9e indirectement<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> en confiant des march\u00e9s publics \u00e0 des ETA.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28de7bb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"28de7bb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b03d253 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b03d253\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e2e5380 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e2e5380\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Comment les ETA contribuent \u00e0 remplir ces obligations ?<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afc0999 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"afc0999\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u00a0<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Le recours aux ETA peut <\/span><b>\u00eatre valoris\u00e9 et comptabilis\u00e9 dans le cadre de vos obligations l\u00e9gales d\u2019emploi.<\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7fa3a7ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7fa3a7ff\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-763467cf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"763467cf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad2b496 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"ad2b496\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEn Wallonie et \u00e0 Bruxelles\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Jusqu\u2019\u00e0 50 %<\/b> de l\u2019obligation l\u00e9gale d\u2019emploi de personnes en situation de handicap peut \u00eatre remplie via des march\u00e9s publics confi\u00e9s \u00e0 des ETA, calcul\u00e9s en \u00e9quivalents temps plein (ETP) sur base du montant du march\u00e9 par rapport \u00e0 un salaire de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5df3eed2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5df3eed2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1fba2d9e elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"1fba2d9e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAu niveau f\u00e9d\u00e9ral\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Jusqu\u2019\u00e0 un tiers<\/b> de l\u2019obligation l\u00e9gale peut \u00eatre rencontr\u00e9 par le biais de march\u00e9s publics attribu\u00e9s \u00e0 des ETA. \n\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0eaeace e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0eaeace\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce56d16 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ce56d16\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cette valorisation permet aux administrations de <\/span><b>transformer une partie de leurs d\u00e9penses de march\u00e9s publics en \u00e9quivalents d\u2019emploi de personnes en situation de handicap<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a53b71b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a53b71b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4fb50c12 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4fb50c12\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5882530f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5882530f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Les b\u00e9n\u00e9fices op\u00e9rationnels pour votre administration<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c3e42f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0c3e42f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-description\">Conciliez qualit\u00e9 de service, s\u00e9curit\u00e9 juridique, efficacit\u00e9 op\u00e9rationnelle et responsabilit\u00e9 soci\u00e9tale.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-389797d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"389797d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dde989d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"dde989d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ef5ec14 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ef5ec14\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Performance et conformit\u00e9<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7cf3a97 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7cf3a97\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Les ETA r\u00e9pondent \u00e0 vos march\u00e9s publics avec :<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">des <\/span><b>r\u00e9ponses adapt\u00e9es \u00e0 des cahiers des charges exigeants<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> ;<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">la capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 respecter <\/span><b>normes, d\u00e9lais et obligations contractuelles<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> ;<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">une <\/span><b>organisation du travail professionnelle<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, avec encadrement, supervision et tra\u00e7abilit\u00e9.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54452fd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"54452fd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-175ccef elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"175ccef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Qualit\u00e9 de service\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b22337e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b22337e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse de travaux, de prestations de services, de logistique ou de services administratifs, les ETA sont des <\/span><b>partenaires fiables<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, form\u00e9es \u00e0 r\u00e9pondre aux besoins sp\u00e9cifiques des administrations, avec un <\/span><b>niveau d\u2019exigence comparable \u00e0 celui attendu des prestataires priv\u00e9s classiques<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de62b80 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"de62b80\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f3cff32 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f3cff32\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Coh\u00e9rence avec vos politiques publiques<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24193e1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"24193e1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Faire appel \u00e0 des ETA dans vos march\u00e9s publics permet de :<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>renforcer l\u2019impact social de vos achats publics<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">,<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">soutenir <\/span><b>l\u2019emploi local et non-d\u00e9localisable<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">,<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">contribuer concr\u00e8tement \u00e0 l\u2019<\/span><b>inclusion professionnelle des personnes en situation de handicap<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">,<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">int\u00e9grer une <\/span><b>dimension responsable, mesurable et valorisable<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> dans vos proc\u00e9dures de march\u00e9s publics.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17d58ebd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"17d58ebd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"outils\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-602e9da9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"602e9da9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9f1459 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b9f1459\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34e34c2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"34e34c2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"959\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/writing-notepad.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5258261\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/writing-notepad.jpg 640w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/writing-notepad-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/writing-notepad-120x180.jpg 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28c718f7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"28c718f7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34b7cc43 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"34b7cc43\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2fa43fd4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2fa43fd4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Outils concrets pour favoriser l\u2019acc\u00e8s des ETA \u00e0 vos march\u00e9s<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-152ea065 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"152ea065\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pour augmenter la part de march\u00e9s attribu\u00e9s \u00e0 des ETA, plusieurs leviers juridiques et op\u00e9rationnels sont \u00e0 votre disposition :<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1418bf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c1418bf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a00dc15 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"3a00dc15\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">R\u00e9servation de march\u00e9s ou de lots<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">La r\u00e9glementation permet, dans certains cas, de r\u00e9server des march\u00e9s ou des lots \u00e0 des fournisseurs relevant de l\u2019\u00e9conomie sociale d\u2019insertion, dont les ETA. Cela s\u00e9curise l\u2019acc\u00e8s de ces structures \u00e0 la commande publique, dans le respect des r\u00e8gles de concurrence. \n<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eef9866 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"eef9866\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-804e65d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"804e65d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Clauses sociales<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">L\u2019insertion de clauses sociales dans vos cahiers des charges permet d\u2019int\u00e9grer des objectifs d\u2019emploi ou d\u2019inclusion, favorisant m\u00e9caniquement les r\u00e9pondants capables d\u2019y r\u00e9pondre, notamment les ETA, qui poss\u00e8dent une exp\u00e9rience av\u00e9r\u00e9e dans ce domaine.\n<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dda9c76 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"dda9c76\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2e430a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"a2e430a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Allotissement r\u00e9fl\u00e9chi<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Un allotissement pertinent des march\u00e9s (division en lots plus cibl\u00e9s) peut permettre aux ETA de candidater plus facilement \u00e0 certains segments, sans diminuer les exigences de qualit\u00e9 ou de performance.\n<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-708e66d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"708e66d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-32506dd0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"32506dd0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f9841d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1f9841d0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Pr\u00eat \u00e0 int\u00e9grer les ETA dans vos march\u00e9s publics ?\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5798c3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e5798c3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>D\u00e9couvrez notre annuaire d&rsquo;entreprises et trouvez le partenaire id\u00e9al pour vos projets.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90ee631 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"90ee631\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36b001a elementor-mobile-align-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"36b001a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/annuaire-eta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Rechercher une ETA<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68603bfd elementor-mobile-align-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"68603bfd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/secteur\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir les secteurs d'activit\u00e9<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Les ETA pour vos march\u00e9s publics Conciliez conformit\u00e9 l\u00e9gale, qualit\u00e9 de service et impact social dans vos proc\u00e9dures d&rsquo;achat public D\u00e9couvrir les outils Des quotas \u00e0 respecter, des solutions pour y r\u00e9pondre Faire appel aux entreprises de travail adapt\u00e9 dans vos march\u00e9s publics n\u2019est pas simplement une option socialement responsable : c\u2019est un levier strat\u00e9gique, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":62,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5259545","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5259545","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/62"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5259545"}],"version-history":[{"count":130,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5259545\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5267225,"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5259545\/revisions\/5267225"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5259545"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":5258521,"date":"2026-01-08T09:12:28","date_gmt":"2026-01-08T08:12:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/?page_id=5258521"},"modified":"2026-06-17T11:14:21","modified_gmt":"2026-06-17T09:14:21","slug":"travailler-en-eta","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/leseta.be\/travailler-en-eta\/","title":{"rendered":"Travailler en ETA"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5258521\" class=\"elementor elementor-5258521\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23041957 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"23041957\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16752fb6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"16752fb6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-22a04cf8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"22a04cf8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Travailler en ETA<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52cf2f07 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"52cf2f07\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid gap-4 [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0\"><div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid gap-4 [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0\"><p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Les Entreprises de Travail Adapt\u00e9 constituent souvent la principale opportunit\u00e9 d&rsquo;acc\u00e8s \u00e0 l&#8217;emploi pour les personnes en situation de handicap, tout en offrant un cadre d&rsquo;insertion sociale et d&rsquo;\u00e9panouissement professionnel optimal.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cbed280 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cbed280\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f24f6a2 elementor-mobile-align-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"f24f6a2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"#criteres\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">D\u00e9couvrir les crit\u00e8res<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fab7211 elementor-mobile-align-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"fab7211\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/eta.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le PDF FALC<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f49880e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f49880e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4244da9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"4244da9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"background:#0A1297;padding:25px 15px;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 id=\"falc-title\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;\">\n        Lire plus facilement\n      <\/h2>\n      <p id=\"falc-desc\" style=\"margin:5px 0 0;font-size:18px;opacity:1;font-weight:500\">\n        Activez la version facile \u00e0 lire et \u00e0 comprendre (FALC).\n      <\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <button id=\"falc-toggle\" onclick=\"toggleFalc()\"\n      style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;color:#0A1297;border:none;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;\">\n      <img decoding=\"async\" \n        src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Logo-FALC.jpg\"\n        style=\"height:40px;width:auto;border-radius:50px\"\n        alt=\"Logo FALC - Format accessible\"\n      >\n      <span id=\"falc-btn-text\">Version FALC<\/span>\n    <\/button>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<script>\nvar sections_normales = [\n  'competences',\n  'offrent',\n  'travaillent',\n  'criteres'\n];\n\nfunction showNormale() {\n  sections_normales.forEach(function(id) {\n    var el = document.getElementById(id);\n    if (el) el.style.display = '';\n  });\n  document.getElementById('section-falc').style.display = 'none';\n  updateBanner(false);\n  const url = new URL(window.location);\n  url.searchParams.delete('falc');\n  window.history.replaceState({}, '', url);\n  window.scrollTo({top: 0, behavior: 'smooth'});\n}\n\nfunction showFalc() {\n  sections_normales.forEach(function(id) {\n    var el = document.getElementById(id);\n    if (el) el.style.display = 'none';\n  });\n  document.getElementById('section-falc').style.display = 'block';\n  updateBanner(true);\n  const url = new URL(window.location);\n  url.searchParams.set('falc', '1');\n  window.history.replaceState({}, '', url);\n  window.scrollTo({top: 0, behavior: 'smooth'});\n}\n\nfunction toggleFalc() {\n  const isFalc = document.body.classList.contains('falc-active');\n  if (isFalc) {\n    showNormale();\n  } else {\n    showFalc();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction updateBanner(isFalc) {\n  const title = document.getElementById('falc-title');\n  const desc = document.getElementById('falc-desc');\n  const btnText = document.getElementById('falc-btn-text');\n  const btn = document.getElementById('falc-toggle');\n  if (isFalc) {\n    document.body.classList.add('falc-active');\n    title.innerText = \"Version facile activ\u00e9e\";\n    desc.innerText = \"Vous consultez une version simplifi\u00e9e.\";\n    btnText.innerText = \"Revenir \u00e0 la version normale\";\n    btn.style.background = \"#fff\";\n    btn.style.color = \"#0A1297\";\n  } else {\n    document.body.classList.remove('falc-active');\n    title.innerText = \"Lire plus facilement\";\n    desc.innerText = \"Activez la version facile \u00e0 lire et \u00e0 comprendre (FALC).\";\n    btnText.innerText = \"Version FALC\";\n    btn.style.background = \"#fff\";\n    btn.style.color = \"#0A1297\";\n  }\n}\n\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n  const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n  if (params.get('falc') === '1') {\n    showFalc();\n  } else {\n    showNormale();\n  }\n});\n<\/script>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e6bcada e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e6bcada\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"section-falc\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-156ff13 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"156ff13\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-480a100 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"480a100\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">C\u2019est quoi une <span style=\"color:#4562B8\">E.T.A.<\/span> ?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1cda3d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1cda3d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Une <span class=\"falc-mot\">E.T.A.<\/span> est une <span class=\"falc-mot\">E<\/span>ntreprise de <span class=\"falc-mot\">T<\/span>ravail <span class=\"falc-mot\">A<\/span>dapt\u00e9.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-493b5b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"493b5b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Par exemple, des personnes :<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-eleme