\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">...<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41af1cd elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"41af1cd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/handicap-travaillent-1024x512.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5265754\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/handicap-travaillent-1024x512.png 1024w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/handicap-travaillent-300x150.png 300w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/handicap-travaillent-768x384.png 768w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/handicap-travaillent.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c044ba2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c044ba2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e755de elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1e755de\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Quand tu travailles dans une <span style=\"color:#4562B8\">E.T.A.<\/span> , <\/br>\n<span style=\"color:#4562B8\">tu signes un contrat de travail<\/span>.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8b695b1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8b695b1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element e