\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">...<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df921ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"df921ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Toutes les E.T.A. ne font pas les m\u00eames travaux.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87705fd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"87705fd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f328238 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f328238\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">O\u00f9 trouver des infos sur les E.T.A. ?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3bd51d5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3bd51d5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6840441 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6840441\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIl y a beaucoup d\u2019<span class=\"falc-mot\">E.T.A.<\/span> en Wallonie.<\/br>\nIl y a surement une <span class=\"falc-mot\">E.T.A.<\/span> pr\u00e8s de chez toi.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-378fa42 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"378fa42\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"570\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/belgique-1024x730.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5265749\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/belgique-1024x730.png 1024w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/belgique-300x214.png 300w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/belgique-768x547.png 768w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/belgique.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b2a4c33 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b2a4c33\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b947cb3 elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"b947cb3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-globe\" viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M336.5 160C322 70.7 287.8 8 248 8s-74 62.7-88.5 152h177zM152 256c0 22.2 1.2 43.5 3.3 64h185.3c2.1-20.5 3.3-41.8 3.3-64s-1.2-43.5-3.3-64H155.3c-2.1 20.5-3.3 41.8-3.3 64zm324.7-96c-28.6-67.9-86.5-120.4-158-141.6 24.4 33.8 41.2 84.7 50 141.6h108zM177.2 18.4C105.8 39.6 47.8 92.1 19.3 160h108c8.7-56.9 25.5-107.8 49.9-141.6zM487.4 192H372.7c2.1 21 3.3 4