ata-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Des comp\u00e9tences professionnelles reconnues\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27d18f0e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"27d18f0e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Les travailleurs des ETA pr\u00e9sentent des <strong>profils tr\u00e8s diff\u00e9rents<\/strong>.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ac3ad0f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7ac3ad0f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f34062c e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f34062c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-038a8bf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"038a8bf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a6582b6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a6582b6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Handicap visible ou invisible\n<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c6f238c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c6f238c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"profile-card\"><p class=\"profile-description\">Personnes pr\u00e9sentant un handicap physique, sensoriel, mental, psychique ou cognitif, visible ou non.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-680e88b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"680e88b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4bfbd4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f4bfbd4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Accident de travail\n<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3db3374 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3db3374\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"profile-card\"><div class=\"profile-card\"><p class=\"profile-description\">Personnes ayant v\u00e9cu un accident de travail ou de vie entra\u00eenant un handicap permanent n\u00e9cessitant une adaptation du poste.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4a76f7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a4a76f7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d1c98d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4d1c98d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Maladies chroniques<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b35654 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4b35654\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"profile-card\"><div class=\"profile-card\"><div class=\"profile-card\"><p class=\"profile-description\">Personnes atteintes de maladies chroniques ou invalidantes impactant leur capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 exercer un emploi classique.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-729d3d5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"729d3d5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e6bc9b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e6bc9b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Handicap de naissance\n<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2814837 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2814837\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"benefit-card\"><div class=\"profile-card\"><div class=\"profile-card\"><section class=\"profiles-section\"><div class=\"section-container\"><div class=\"profiles-grid\"><div class=\"profile-card\"><p class=\"profile-description\">Personnes en situation de handicap depuis la naissance b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiant d&rsquo;un accompagnement adapt\u00e9 tout au long de leur parcours.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2443fe8c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2443fe8c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23b871c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"23b871c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Villagen1-12-rkegqt1bk12hufmxm9zowaow7s9re6yo9o13tzfixc.png\" title=\"Villagen1 (12)\" alt=\"Villagen1 (12)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e8683d9 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-absolute elementor-mobile-position-inline-start elementor-shape-circle elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"6e8683d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-suitcase\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M128 480h256V80c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48H176c-26.5 0-48 21.5-48 48v400zm64-384h128v32H192V96zm320 80v256c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48h-48V128h48c26.5 0 48 21.5 48 48zM96 480H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V176c0-26.5 21.5-48 48-48h48v352z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLes ETA constituent souvent la principale opportunit\u00e9 d'acc\u00e8s \u00e0 l'emploi pour les personnes en situation de handicap\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67ebde2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"67ebde2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"offrent\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c6fa348 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2c6fa348\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b43d4c2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4b43d4c2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44a54fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"44a54fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ce que les ETA vous offrent<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-58732de2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"58732de2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-description\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pour toutes ces personnes qui peuvent \u00eatre \u00e9loign\u00e9es de l\u2019emploi, les ETA constituent souvent la <strong>principale opportunit\u00e9 d\u2019acc\u00e8s \u00e0 l\u2019emploi<\/strong>, tout en offrant un <strong>cadre d\u2019insertion sociale<\/strong> et d\u2019<strong>\u00e9panouissement professionnel<\/strong> optimal.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7963baac e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7963baac\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c0b7296 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7c0b7296\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"766\" src=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Villagen1-4.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5262604\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Villagen1-4.png 902w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Villagen1-4-300x287.png 300w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Villagen1-4-768x736.png 768w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Villagen1-4-32x32.png 32w, https:\/\/leseta.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Villagen1-4-188x180.png 188w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-397e65af e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"397e65af\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a0857a3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7a0857a3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24b60d31 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"24b60d31\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c5d673b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5c5d673b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38bd0f7 elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mob